  "summary": "Lightwell Security Advisory: okio 1.17.2.rhlw-00001",
  "details": "Red Hat Lightwell has released com.squareup.okio:okio 1.17.2.rhlw-00001 with a backported security fix.\n\nCVE-2023-3635: GzipSource does not handle an exception that might be raised when parsing a malformed gzip buffer. This may lead to denial of service of the Okio client when handling a crafted GZIP archive, by using the GzipSource class.\n\nThis patched artifact is a drop-in replacement for com.squareup.okio:okio 1.17.2 from Maven Central.",
